sequenceDiagram
  participant RE as recurring-service
  participant EX as expense-service
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant SE as settlement-service
  participant NO as notification-service
  Note over RE: Tâche planifiée le 1er du mois
  RE->>EX: POST /api/expenses {loyer 600€, recurringId} (OpenFeign, retry ×3)
  alt expense-service disponible
    EX-->>RE: 201 {expenseId}
    EX--)MQ: publie expense.created
    MQ--)RE: consomme → programme la prochaine échéance
    MQ--)SE: consomme → 2 dettes de 200€
    RE--)MQ: publie recurring.triggered
    MQ--)NO: notifie le groupe
  else indisponible après retries
    RE->>RE: Execution = FAILED
    RE--)MQ: publie recurring.failed
    MQ--)NO: alerte le créateur
  end
